{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_banner01.png?t=1753290994\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Caput Mortum is a short first-person horror experience inspired by retro 3D dungeon crawlers and survival horror games. Delve into a tower of forgotten nightmares, where every step could be your last. Overcome horrors from beyond death and unlock the secrets of forbidden knowledge.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udf0d SLOW BURN HORROR\u00a0\ud83d\udf0d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif05.gif?t=1753290994\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Close the lights, put on headphones, and immerse yourself in the game's macabre world. Behind every door lurks a new terror, and in every corner a key to some eldritch secret. Pay close attention to your surroundings, overcome <strong>unique\u00a0puzzles</strong>, and piece together the events that took place within the tower. How deep are you willing to go, and what terrible truths will you uncover?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u263f NIGHTMARISH BEINGS\u00a0\u263f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif06.gif?t=1753290994\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must stay vigilant, as <strong>varied monsters</strong> roam the abandoned halls of the tower and won't hesitate to attack. Stealth past them, fight back, or perhaps... something else? Just be mindful of your health. There are only so many healing items in the game. This is old school, remember?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udf14 UNIQUE CONTROLS\u00a0\ud83d\udf14</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif04.gif?t=1753290994\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a control scheme reminiscent of old-school dungeon crawlers that makes you feel more <strong>vulnerable</strong>, and control your <strong>right hand</strong> separately to interact with objects and attack creatures. Several control options are available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Controller (Default):</i></strong> The recommended way of playing Caput Mortum. The controls make you feel vulnerable while remaining fair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Controller (King's Field):</i></strong> For nostalgic players! You can control the camera and move your character like in the<i> King's Field</i>\u00a0games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Keyboard Only:</i></strong>\u00a0If you don't own a controller but still want the feeling of vulnerability, this is the option for you! Control the camera and your hand with the arrow keys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Keyboard &amp; Mouse:</i></strong> This is for\u00a0players wanting a more familiar experience. Control the camera and your hand with the mouse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/WildArts_Logo_MadeByHumans_banner.png?t=1753290994\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555980?t=1753290994","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/78972b7e106d883a29e78bce31dd93231850e861/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753290994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/9fead771b209b8661db6c148befcf51a8cb9042f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753290994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/9fead771b209b8661db6c148befcf51a8cb9042f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753290994","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depictions of death; monstrous creatures; experiments on humans; and horror themes."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3651330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_banner01.png?t=1753290994\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Caput Mortum is a short first-person horror experience inspired by retro 3D dungeon crawlers and survival horror games. Delve into a tower of forgotten nightmares, where every step could be your last. Overcome horrors from beyond death and unlock the secrets of forbidden knowledge.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udf0d SLOW BURN HORROR\u00a0\ud83d\udf0d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif05.gif?t=1753290994\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Close the lights, put on headphones, and immerse yourself in the game's macabre world. Behind every door lurks a new terror, and in every corner a key to some eldritch secret. Pay close attention to your surroundings, overcome <strong>unique\u00a0puzzles</strong>, and piece together the events that took place within the tower. How deep are you willing to go, and what terrible truths will you uncover?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u263f NIGHTMARISH BEINGS\u00a0\u263f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif06.gif?t=1753290994\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must stay vigilant, as <strong>varied monsters</strong> roam the abandoned halls of the tower and won't hesitate to attack. Stealth past them, fight back, or perhaps... something else? Just be mindful of your health. There are only so many healing items in the game. This is old school, remember?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udf14 UNIQUE CONTROLS\u00a0\ud83d\udf14</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif04.gif?t=1753290994\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a control scheme reminiscent of old-school dungeon crawlers that makes you feel more <strong>vulnerable</strong>, and control your <strong>right hand</strong> separately to interact with objects and attack creatures. Several control options are available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Controller (Default):</i></strong> The recommended way of playing Caput Mortum. The controls make you feel vulnerable while remaining fair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Controller (King's Field):</i></strong> For nostalgic players! You can control the camera and move your character like in the<i> King's Field</i>\u00a0games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Keyboard Only:</i></strong>\u00a0If you don't own a controller but still want the feeling of vulnerability, this is the option for you! Control the camera and your hand with the arrow keys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Keyboard &amp; Mouse:</i></strong> This is for\u00a0players wanting a more familiar experience. Control the camera and your hand with the mouse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/WildArts_Logo_MadeByHumans_banner.png?t=1753290994\" /></div></p>","developers":["WildArts Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/b89f03423ac988bf2a14e984c247c506e0d372a9/header.jpg?t=1753290994","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257142178,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142178/movie480.mp4?t=1749517809","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142178/movie_max.mp4?t=1749517809"},"name":"Caput Mortum | Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142178/687cbe2955ef710ef1288dbdfe8ccb92e5b05c2f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749517809","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142178/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749517809","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142178/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749517809"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257108013,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108013/movie480.mp4?t=1747748436","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108013/movie_max.mp4?t=1747748436"},"name":"Caput Mortum | Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108013/5ad6913f83dbff2225fd632fa4687512afb2f528/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747748436","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108013/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747748436","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108013/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747748436"}}],"name":"Caput Mortum","package_groups